en  engages chang in a fight chang uses his  iron fists to deliver several swift  blows at the blind man but chan  tactfully uses his iron staff to block  them chen and chang are evenly matched  in skill as both men showcase  extraordinary speed and agility soon  after yi joins the fight and with his  help chen gains the upper hand chen and  yi use a pair of metal rings and launch  a coordinated attack at chang managing  to snap his neck in the process  sadly before chang falls he delivers a  fatal blow to yi severely injuring the  mentally disabled man who dies shortly  after chen takes a moment to mourn ye  but immediately joins way as the duo  fight teon 2 together a while later akui  also joins them and the trio  collectively battles the tiger-style  user the final battle is ferocious like  a tiger but unlike anything the cripples  had previously encountered the men used  the surrounding tables to their  advantage launching aerial kicks at tian  ii but the master fighter dodges the  attacks despite their number tiantu  keeps up with them and matches their  acrobatic movements after a lengthy  battle wei and chen immobilized tian ii  while akui delivers a finishing kick  with his iron feet the tyrant is  astonished by the power of akui's kick  and realizes that he has a pair of iron  feet however it is too late tiantu falls  to the ground due to the kick's impact  and dies the movie ends as the three  cripples leave the mansion with bright  smiles having successfully enacted their  revenge the moral of the story is that  revenge is never worth it but sometimes  it's worth it subscribe for more videos  like this turn on notifications and  leave a like to help the channel out  thank you for watching
 

